Path:
-----
A path tells the computer where a file or folder is located.



1. Absolute Path - complete location of a file or folder

ex: D:\7react\node_07\class-03\index.js
    D:\7react\node_07\class-03


2. Relative Path - where a file is located relative to the current location

class-03\index.js
read.me

Important relative path symbols:
--------------------------------

.  - current directory
.. - parent directory

/  - Go inside a directory
../ - go one level up

